# nint crossing HSPICE is a caveat (04b5199f).
# What the fix was for, as the ledger has it: output `.param p='nint(x)'`; `warning[caveat]`
# containing `nint in hspice: halves round away from zero (nint(2.5) is 3), not to even`.
from: ngspice
to: hspice
--- input
t
.param x=2.5
.param p={nint(x)}
.end
--- output
t
.option tnom=27
.param x=2.5
.param p='nint(x)'
.end
--- report
warning[caveat]: options: ngspice assumes other defaults for tnom than hspice does; they are written out
warning[caveat]: line 3: expression 'nint(x)': nint in hspice: halves round away from zero (nint(2.5) is 3), not to even
